    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>Working as a freelance writer is best when you can share with the world something you've seen first-hand, like a true reporter. However, your latest assignment is nothing like that. You've been tasked to write about dating advice... but how can you write about something that you've never experienced?<br><br>Right as you're about to smash your head into the wall from writer's block, there is a knock at your door! Who could it be?<br><br>Standing at your doorstep, drenched from the rain, is a young, beautiful... catgirl?! She seems to know you, yet you have no recollection of her. She claims to be on a divine mission - to be your girlfriend! But she's not the only unexpected guest. A second catgirl shows up soon after with the same higher calling...<br><br>This must be a dream, right?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new kind of visual novel with ASMR scenes, best enjoyed through your headphones!<br></li><li>A fun linear story with kawaii catgirls<br></li><li>Fully voiced in Japanese</li></ul>",
